SUMMARY:A minimization problem of the Klein-Gordon-Schrödinger system and related topics
DESCRIPTION:We consider the Klein-Gordon-Schrödinger system in 4 dimensions. We show some results about a minimization problem and instability of standing waves. These results are based on joint works with Masaru Hamano (Kyoto University) and Hiroaki Kikuchi (Tsuda University).\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16534/
